      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "To elevate this from a complaint to a declaration of ownership, frame your vision as the *source* of the cultural movement, not just a contributor. Use evocative language to contrast your authentic, deeply understood sound with the commodified versions currently circulating. Position your work as the essential, foundational truth that the newer wave is merely mimicking or referencing. This shifts the focus from personal grievance to historical necessity.",
      "source": "target",
